"""Settings UI for mousetouch (GTK4 + libadwaita).

Edits ~/.config/mousetouch/config.toml. The daemon watches the file
and reloads on every save, so changes apply immediately.

Theme and language follow the desktop by default and can be overridden
from the Appearance group; those preferences live in ui.toml next to the
config so the daemon never sees them.

The live view at the top draws what the daemon sees on the mouse (fingers,
taps, swipes, pinch, scrolling, clicks) from the daemon's event stream.
"""
